    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The bravo gains a combat or skill talent at 1st, 2nd, and 3rd level, and 3/4ths of a talent thereafter, according to Table: Bravo. In addition, they gain a utility talent at every even level. A bravo uses his operative modifier as his practitioner modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
